      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "To ensure safety, provide the kitchen with clear, pre-printed allergy matrices detailing the 12 severe peanut cases and the 8 vegan guests. Instruct the kitchen to prepare dedicated, cross-contaminated-free stations for these specific dietary needs. For the buffet, use prominent, color-coded signage indicating \"Vegan\" or \"Contains Peanuts,\" and ensure staff members actively monitor the line to direct guests safely.",
