    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That sounds good. For the signage, do you think we should just do standard text labels, or is there a more professional/elegant way to do it that still holds the importance of a medical allergy? I don't want it to look like a school cafeteria, but I also can't risk anyone getting sick.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
