      "content": "For a high-end corporate gala, combine elegant design with uncompromising clarity for medical safety. Utilize high-quality, script-like signage featuring clear iconographic representations (like a peanut symbol with a strike-through) alongside concise text labels. Consider adding a brief disclaimer next to all items stating, \"Please inform your server if you have allergies.\" This maintains sophistication while prioritizing the critical safety information.",
