    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. One more thing—given the high stakes with the law firm, I'm a bit paranoid about the staff actually following through and not making mistakes. Do you have any advice on how to do a final \"audit\" or check-in with the kitchen right before the food goes out to ensure the vegan and nut-free trays are definitely isolated and haven't been compromised by something like a common serving spoon? I want to be 100% sure there are no surprises.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
